\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God is ascended up on high, 
\par                                      Alleluia.
\par With merry noise of trumpet's sound,
\par                                          Alleluia.
\par And princely seated in the sky,
\par                                       Alleluia.
\par Rules over all the world around.
\par                                       Alleluia.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In human shape and flesh He went,
\par                                             Alleluia.
\par Adorned with His passion's scars,
\par                                           Alleluia.
\par Which in heaven's sight He did present
\par                                          Alleluia.
\par More glorious than the glittering stars.
\par                                           Alleluia.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, raise our sinking minds therefore
\par                                          Alleluia.
\par Up to our proper country dear,
\par                                          Alleluia.
\par And purify us evermore,
\par                                   Alleluia.
\par To fit us for those regions clear.
\par                                     Alleluia.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
